  "description": "After leaving behind his past as a failed idol from Meteor Boys, Seok-Wu returns to university hoping for a fresh start. Unfortunately, his timing could not be worse…because rising star Yeo-Wun, a rookie actor with a glittering career, also reenrolls. Seok-Wu is used to the contrast in how people treat them, but when Yeo-Wun starts provoking him in ways that feel far too deliberate, irritation turns into wounded pride. Just how far does Yeo-Wun plan to trample on Seok-Wu’s dignity - and why does it feel so personal?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
